      ],
      "source": "https://coalcampusa.com/nowv/fairmont/century/century.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Our Lady of Sorrows Catholic Church was likely built for the Italian, Polish, and Slovak immigrants who lived in the coal camp.",
